(b)Saskatchewan;
(c)Northwest Territories;
(d)Yukon;
(e)New Brunswick;
(f)British Columbia;
(g)Newfoundland and Labrador;
(h)Nova Scotia;
(i)Nunavut
5.Cook Islands
6.All the States of the Republic of India except the States of Jammu and Kashmir
7.The Republic of Malawi
8.Malaysia
9.Niue
